          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So again, it's the ego here. \"Who will endure the day of his coming?\"",
      "start": 267.02,
      "end": 271.63,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
