          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Lahab?",
          "start": 421.86,
          "end": 422.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Abu Lahab was the religious leader of his time, following the corrupted religion of Abraham, Islam or submission.",
