          "end": 1048.76,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to.",
          "start": 1048.76,
          "end": 1049.02,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[2:90]  Miserable indeed is what they sold their souls for, disbelieving in God's revelations out of sheer resentment that God should bestow His grace upon whomever He chooses from among His servants. Consequently, they incurred wrath upon wrath. Such disbelievers have deserved humiliating retribution.",
      "start": 1049.02,
      "end": 1157.68,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
