    {
      "text": "[2:91]  When they are told, \"You shall believe in what GOD had sent down herein,\" they say, \"We believe only in what was sent down to us.\" They reject subsequent revelations, even if it is the truth from their Lord, and even though it confirms what they have! Say, \"if you did believe in the revelations given to you, why then did you kill God's prophets, if you are truthful?\"",
