    {
      "text": "[2:93]  Also, we made a covenant with you, as we raised Mount Sinai above you, saying, \"You shall uphold the commandments we have given you, strongly, and listen.\" But they said, \"We hear, but we disobey.\" Their hearts became filled with adoration for the calf, due to their disbelief. Say, \"Miserable indeed is what your faith dictates upon you, if you do have any faith.\"",
