          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " save",
          "start": 2940.35,
          "end": 2940.37,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " you.",
          "start": 2940.37,
          "end": 2940.55,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God is the One who controls your kidneys and lungs, controls your health, your happiness. Directly, God says that in Sura 54.",
