    {
      "text": "God is... This is the Arabic.",
      "start": 2980.69,
      "end": 2996.98,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 2980.69,
          "end": 2983.13,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " is...",
          "start": 2983.13,
          "end": 2985.45,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " This",
          "start": 2996.73,
          "end": 2996.77,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 2996.77,
          "end": 2996.77,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 2996.77,
          "end": 2996.83,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " Arabic.",
          "start": 2996.83,
          "end": 2996.98,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Very clearly, God controls your happiness.",
      "start": 3000.03,
      "end": 3046.41,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Very",
          "start": 3000.03,
          "end": 3000.13,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " clearly,",
          "start": 3000.13,
          "end": 3000.13,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 3000.59,
          "end": 3000.59,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " controls",
          "start": 3000.89,
          "end": 3001.09,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3044.71,
          "end": 3044.81,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " happiness.",
          "start": 3044.81,
          "end": 3046.41,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing else, your friends, your relatives, your parents, your children.",
      "start": 3053.51,
      "end": 3059.77,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Nothing",
          "start": 3053.51,
          "end": 3053.95,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " else,",
          "start": 3053.95,
          "end": 3053.95,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3054.03,
          "end": 3054.05,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " friends,",
          "start": 3054.05,
          "end": 3054.57,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3054.79,
          "end": 3054.79,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " relatives,",
          "start": 3054.79,
          "end": 3055.43,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3055.51,
          "end": 3055.51,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " parents,",
          "start": 3055.51,
          "end": 3058.11,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3059.77,
          "end": 3059.77,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " children.",
          "start": 3059.77,
          "end": 3059.77,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nobody controls your happiness or misery.",
      "start": 3059.77,
      "end": 3060.73,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Nobody",
          "start": 3059.77,
          "end": 3059.77,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " controls",
          "start": 3059.77,
          "end": 3059.81,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3059.81,
          "end": 3059.81,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " happiness",
          "start": 3059.81,
          "end": 3060.51,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 3060.51,
          "end": 3060.65,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " misery.",
          "start": 3060.65,
          "end": 3060.73,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God is the only One who controls happiness.",
      "start": 3060.73,
      "end": 3062.09,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 3060.73,
          "end": 3060.73,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3060.73,
          "end": 3060.73,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3060.73,
          "end": 3060.73,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " only",
          "start": 3060.73,
          "end": 3060.91,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " One",
          "start": 3060.91,
          "end": 3060.91,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " who",
          "start": 3060.91,
          "end": 3062.07,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " controls",
          "start": 3062.07,
          "end": 3062.09,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " happiness.",
          "start": 3062.09,
          "end": 3062.09,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Therefore, if you are wise or intelligent, you don't care what people say.",
      "start": 3062.81,
      "end": 3062.97,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Therefore,",
