          "end": 4429.81,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " big",
          "start": 4429.81,
          "end": 4429.95,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " deal,",
          "start": 4429.95,
          "end": 4430.05,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " actually.",
          "start": 4433.59,
          "end": 4434.55,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I think you go to the library and learn magic, witchcraft. There are many books on witchcraft.",
