          "end": 4515.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " slave.",
          "start": 4515.65,
          "end": 4515.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They will fool you for a while. They will do certain things for you.",
