        },
        {
          "word": " long.",
          "start": 4535.77,
          "end": 4535.77,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe a few months and then they disappear. Otherwise, it would have been a big hit.",
