          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So that you don't get more of a pinch than you deserve. So, when you miss a Prayer, you get a pinch.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
