          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " something?",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I said \"those who possess no knowledge have uttered the same kind of utterances.\" They're just Muslims today.",
