          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, exactly.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes,",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " exactly.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, sir?",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes,",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " sir?",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, a few, quite a few. In fact, we passed... maybe coming up, and we passed a couple of them.",
