          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " yet.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But this Sura, according to also traditional knowledge, also has two names.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sura,",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " according",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " also",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " traditional",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " knowledge,",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " also",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " has",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " two",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " names.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It is Tawbah or Bar\u00e3'ah. Some people use Bar\u00e3'ah, but it's also Bar\u00e3'ah.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " It",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Tawbah",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Bar\u00e3'ah.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Some",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " people",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " use",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Bar\u00e3'ah,",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " but",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " it's",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " also",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Bar\u00e3'ah.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it is well known as Bar\u00e3'ah and Tawbah, but Tawbah is a strange name. It's a foreign name.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
