          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " name.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In fact, I see it here. We should have changed that to Arabic.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
