          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Bar\u00e3'ah.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. I'm sure there is some mathematical basis for it.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I'm",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " sure",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " some",
