        },
        {
          "word": " basis",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a good question.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " That's",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " good",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " question.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The names of the Suras were divinely inspired.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " names",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Suras",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " were",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " divinely",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " inspired.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is why this is The Heifer (Al-Baqarah), for example, and not anything else.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " This",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " why",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Heifer",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " (Al-Baqarah),",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " example,",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " anything",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " else.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even though there are many important subjects in this Sura.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Even",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " though",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " are",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " many",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " important",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " subjects",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sura.",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But if you look at the old books, all of them say \"Bar\u00e3'ah,\" up to 100 years ago.",
      "start": 5346.86,
      "end": 5346.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " if",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " look",
          "start": 5346.86,
          "end": 5346.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
